---
// Final CTA — bloque oscuro con naranja explotando
---

<section
  id="contacto-cta"
  class="border-t relative overflow-hidden"
  style="border-color: var(--color-line); background-color: var(--color-ink); color: var(--color-paper);"
>
  <div class="container-craft py-24 md:py-36 relative">
    <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr] lg:gap-20 lg:items-end">
      <div class="reveal">
        <div
          class="eyebrow"
          style="color: var(--color-brand); letter-spacing: 0.22em;"
        >
          04 · Próximo paso
        </div>
        <h2
          class="display-hero mt-6"
          style="color: var(--color-paper); font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);"
        >
          ¿Un proyecto<br />
          <span style="color: var(--color-spark);">en mente?</span>
        </h2>
        <p
          class="mt-8 max-w-[52ch] text-[1.0625rem] leading-relaxed"
          style="color: rgba(250,250,247,0.78);"
        >
          Cotización con visita técnica incluida. Sin respuestas genéricas. Le contestamos en menos de 24 horas hábiles.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a href="/contacto" class="btn-primary">
            Solicitar cotización
            <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </a>
          <a
            href="mailto:info@netfic.com"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-[0.95rem] font-semibold text-[0.95rem] rounded-full border transition-colors duration-200"
            style="color: var(--color-paper); border-color: rgba(250,250,247,0.32);"
            onmouseover="this.style.backgroundColor='rgba(250,250,247,0.08)'"
            onmouseout="this.style.backgroundColor='transparent'"
          >
            Escribir un correo
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <dl class="reveal reveal-d1 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-1 gap-7">
        <div>
          <dt class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase font-bold mb-2" style="letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: rgba(250,250,247,0.5);">
            Teléfono
          </dt>
          <dd class="text-[1.0625rem]" style="color: var(--color-paper);">
            <a href="tel:+50685082921" class="tabular-nums hover:underline underline-offset-4">+506 8508 2921</a>
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase font-bold mb-2" style="letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: rgba(250,250,247,0.5);">
            Cobertura
          </dt>
          <dd class="text-[1.0625rem]" style="color: var(--color-paper);">
            Toda Costa Rica · viajes incluidos en cotización
          </dd>
        </div>
        <div>
          <dt class="text-[0.7rem] uppercase font-bold mb-2" style="letter-spacing: 0.22em; color: rgba(250,250,247,0.5);">
            Horario
          </dt>
          <dd class="text-[1.0625rem]" style="color: var(--color-paper);">
            Lun a Vie · 9:00 — 18:00
          </dd>
        </div>
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
